window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-760c8443bfac84be"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"audit-course-section-consistency\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">审核不同教学班的课程一致性</h1> <p>对照同一课程的多个教学班，同时保留教师的自主裁量空间。</p> <p>使用 ChatGPT 对照不同教学班的课程大纲、时间表、作业、政策、LMS 导出数据和院系指导，制作有证据支持的一致性审计，列出冲突、优先级和负责人。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>具有共同学习成果或共同要求的多教学班课程。</li> <li>需要检查不同教学班面向学生的信息是否冲突的院系。</li> <li>必须区分必需对齐的要求与教师自主选择内容的审计工作。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>google-drive</code></td> <td>收集各教学班的课程大纲、作业说明、时间安排和院系指导。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>制作跨教学班的对照表，其中包含证据、优先级和负责人。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">起步提示词</h2> <p>审核不同教学班的课程</p> <p>建议推理级别：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">请比较这些教学班的课程大纲、作业、时间安排、LMS 导出数据、课程学习成果、院系指导和教师备注。\n\n请创建一份一致性审计，用于：\n- 区分必须对齐的要求与教师自主裁量的内容\n- 标出面向学生的信息冲突\n- 为每项发现注明来源\n- 提出包含负责人的基准检查清单\n- 按紧急程度和影响排列修复事项\n\n请返回供教师审核的草稿，不要覆盖源材料。\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">插件</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"establish-the-shared-baseline\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">确定共同基准</h2> <p>从课程共同的学习成果、院系要求以及适用于所有教学班的政策开始。然后加入各教学班的课程大纲、时间安排、作业、评分权重、LMS 指引和教师备注。</p> <p>将必须保持一致的内容与教师可选择不同做法的领域分开标注。</p> <p><a id=\"run-the-comparison\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">进行比较</h2> <p>请 ChatGPT 按照一组固定维度对照各教学班：</p> <ol> <li>学习成果和必需内容。</li> <li>评分权重和评估要求。</li> <li>截止日期、出勤和迟交作业的说明。</li> <li>作业说明和面向学生的术语。</li> <li>LMS 中的内容可见性和导航方式。</li> <li>合理的教师个人选择。</li> </ol> <p>每项冲突都应附上来源，并解释它对学生的影响。</p> <p><a id=\"resolve-findings-with-faculty\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_8\">与教师一起处理发现的问题</h2> <p>与各教学班负责人一起审核审计结果。确认每项差异属于错误、已批准的不同做法，还是尚未解决的政策问题。</p> <p>做出决定后，请 ChatGPT 提供一份包含负责人的基准检查清单和建议措辞。只有在相关教师批准后，才能更新源材料。</p>","en":"<h1 id=\"audit-course-section-consistency\">Audit course section consistency</h1> <p>Compare shared courses while preserving instructor discretion.</p> <p>Use ChatGPT to compare section syllabi, schedules, assignments, policies, LMS exports, and department guidance, then create an evidence-backed consistency audit with conflicts, priorities, and owners.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Multi-section courses with shared outcomes or requirements.</li> <li>Departments reviewing student-facing conflicts across sections.</li> <li>Audits that must distinguish required alignment from instructor choice.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>google-drive</code></td> <td>Gather section syllabi, assignment prompts, schedules, and department guidance.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>Build a cross-section comparison with evidence, priorities, and owners.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Audit Course Sections</p> <p>Suggested reasoning effort：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Compare the syllabi, assignments, schedules, LMS exports, course outcomes, department guidance, and instructor notes for these sections.\n\nCreate a consistency audit that:\n- separates required alignment from instructor discretion\n- flags student-facing conflicts\n- cites the source for every finding\n- recommends a baseline checklist with owners\n- ranks fixes by urgency and impact\n\nReturn a draft for faculty review and do not overwrite source materials.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">Plugins</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"establish-the-shared-baseline\">Establish the shared baseline</h2> <p>Start with the common course outcomes, department requirements, and any policies that apply to every section. Then add each section's syllabus, schedule, assignments, grading weights, LMS guidance, and instructor notes.</p> <p>Label required elements separately from areas where instructors may choose different approaches.</p> <h2 id=\"run-the-comparison\">Run the comparison</h2> <p>Ask ChatGPT to compare the sections across a stable set of dimensions:</p> <ol> <li>Outcomes and required content.</li> <li>Grading weights and assessment expectations.</li> <li>Due-date, attendance, and late-work language.</li> <li>Assignment instructions and student-facing terminology.</li> <li>LMS visibility and navigation.</li> <li>Legitimate instructor-specific choices.</li> </ol> <p>For every conflict, require a source reference and an explanation of the student impact.</p> <h2 id=\"resolve-findings-with-faculty\">Resolve findings with faculty</h2> <p>Review the audit with the section leads. Confirm whether each difference is an error, an approved variation, or an unresolved policy question.</p> <p>Once decisions are made, ask ChatGPT for a baseline checklist with owners and proposed language. Update source materials only after the relevant instructors approve the changes.</p>"};
